  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/3FTP\r\n\r\nOffering space, flexibility and an enviable coastal lifestyle, this five-bedroom, two-bathroom home is well suited to growing families, extended family or those looking for extra separation under one roof.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the light-filled lounge opens onto the front porch, creating an inviting, sunny space to relax and unwind. The contemporary open-plan kitchen and dining area provides a practical hub for everyday family life, while a large back deck offers plenty of room for outdoor entertaining, summer BBQs or simply enjoying time with family and friends.\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms on this level are serviced by a family bathroom, while a separate, generously sized laundry adds further convenience.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, a separate entrance enhances the versatility of the home. This level features a bedroom, semi-ensuite bathroom and lounge, currently being used as a fifth bedroom, along with another laundry. The flexible layout provides plenty of options for teenagers, extended family or flatmates who would appreciate their own space and privacy. Complete with a lock-up garage provides secure parking and plenty of additional off-street parking. \r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate being within walking distance of Sherwood School and Northcross Intermediate, with Long Bay College also in zone. The location puts everyday essentials and coastal living within easy reach, Browns Bay Beach and Village are just a stroll away. Supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, shops, parks and reserves are all close to home.\r\n\r\nWith the Vendor downsizing, the decision has been made - now it's your opportunity to secure this spacious and versatile family home. Come and see it for yourself.\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
